            <h1 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Welcome to ReconXi</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;">Thanks for signing up</p>

            <p style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 30px;">Hi {{ $user->name }}</p>

            <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 30px;">We know how challenging it can be to manage transactions, and ensure financial accuracy.</p>

            <p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 24px;">Here's what you can expect:</p>

            <table style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 30px; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0 10px;">
                <tr>
                    <td style="vertical-align: bottom; padding-right: 16px; width: 24px; color: #2E604A;">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M12 0L15.2414 8.75862L24 12L15.2414 15.2414L12 24L8.75862 15.2414L0 12L8.75862 8.75862L12 0Z" fill="#2E604A" fill-opacity="0.8"/>
                            </svg>
                    </td>
                    <td style="vertical-align: top;">
                        <p style="margin: 0;">
                            <b style="font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 4px 0; white-space: nowrap;">Ai Powered Reconciliation:</b>
                            Save hours through Ai powered repetitive reconciliation processes.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="vertical-align: bottom; padding-right: 16px; margin-top: 10px; width: 24px; color: #2E604A;">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M12 0L15.2414 8.75862L24 12L15.2414 15.2414L12 24L8.75862 15.2414L0 12L8.75862 8.75862L12 0Z" fill="#2E604A" fill-opacity="0.8"/>
                            </svg>
                    </td>
                    <td style="vertical-align: top;">
                        <p style="margin: 0; ">
                            <b style="font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 4px 0; white-space: nowrap;">Easy to use Reconciled Reports:</b>
                            Minimize human mistakes with intelligent matching and verification.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="vertical-align: center; padding-right: 16px; width: 24px; color: #2E604A;">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M12 0L15.2414 8.75862L24 12L15.2414 15.2414L12 24L8.75862 15.2414L0 12L8.75862 8.75862L12 0Z" fill="#2E604A" fill-opacity="0.8"/>
                            </svg>
                    </td>
                    <td style="vertical-align: top;">
                        <p style="margin: 0;">
                            <b style="font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 4px 0; white-space: nowrap;">Need Assistance?</b>
                            Our support team is here for you! If you have any questions, simply reply to this mail or contact us at support@reconxi.com.
                        </p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>

